msgctxt "employer landing"
msgid "Saving your offer does not start a candidate search. Matching is coming soon."
msgstr "L’enregistrement de votre offre ne lance pas de recherche de candidats. Le rapprochement sera disponible prochainement."

#: eures_beta/templates/employer/landing.html
msgctxt "employer landing"
